を助け、正式に対魔忍となった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉と共に朧に囚われた時、朧の命を受けた佐馬斗によって全身を、なにをしても快楽を感じるような異常な性感帯に肉体改造を施されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アサギのように精神力で対抗できないさくらは、薬によって症状を抑えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"対魔忍養成学校・五車学園に通う2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紫と仲良しだと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「対魔忍さくら参上♪　少し細工をさせてもらったよ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46110"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63cf6886119cadef351a0bd664ca871cb60d1d0e09b44136a671878337721e6d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5ab92c2456d779ac0da4ef70dae2b1011f3ce59ab57a78281c3e4578a8d147e3.webp","width":140,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永井ちひろ","creatorId":"vndb:s530","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s530","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s530","name":"永井 ちひろ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126047:46110:18652:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1412","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1586","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1412","name":"ANIME LiLiTH","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:8187:1586","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p149","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p149","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p149","name":"LILITH｜リリス","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:10711:v731","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p149","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p149","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p149","name":"LILITH｜リリス","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:10712:v731","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p18672","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p18672","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p18672","name":"iqdhk8t0hxww","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-prod